The design system's fonts in web/public/design-system/fonts/ keep their own licences,
OFL-1.1 with CC-BY-4.0 and MIT glyphs; their texts are in LICENSES/ and beside the fonts.

Every file states its own licence, following the REUSE specification
(https://reuse.software/): an SPDX-License-Identifier header in the file, or
an entry in REUSE.toml for files that cannot carry one.

